  m_text: "The root of all spiders. The mothers have a lot of the same tactics as
    the adult spiders. Carrying more advanced Arachnid-Engineering prototypes, the
    MOAS\u2019 shoot faster web balls, and heavier, but slower Arachnid Abdomen Armor.
    The mothers will also make use of their children spitting out (4 or 5) to weigh
    you down to make it easier for the mother to catch you. \r\n"
