--- !u!114 &5624207895886060234
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3543584493121122402}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 17d9e30d4a5b7db4983b471e7c6b037f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  healthBar: {fileID: 7236862628400409423}
  healthText: {fileID: 7135542201901792234}
  staminaGauge: {fileID: 0}
  staminaParent: {fileID: 0}
  deathScreen: {fileID: 1470927601867232702}
  pauseMenu: {fileID: 2558540309890484876}
  mainPause: {fileID: 786250950888748097}
  loreBook: {fileID: 7230810866486236132}
  loreLeft: {fileID: 2603108202090583856}
  loreRight: {fileID: 4078027783606408412}
  loreImage: {fileID: 2239347564596786954}
  loreTitle: {fileID: 1701833492525540181}
  loreBody: {fileID: 7433478284140136681}
  lorePages:
  - ID: 0
    title: <b>SP1T-B4LL</b>
    body: Proprietary FlyTech technology allows for your everyday goo to be launched
      as a projectile toward any predator or meal, even during flight!
    sprite: {fileID: -1912379310005908109, guid: d38b53996648e1b4cb2c7a499adec4c9, type: 3}
  - ID: 0
    title: <b>Primary Fire</b>
    body: A basic goo-ball propelled at enemies
    sprite: {fileID: -2414628221243539506, guid: 86c6746296ed42e4dacf84ceb0cfd128, type: 3}
  - ID: 0
    title: <b>Secondary Fire</b>
    body: Hold down to charge a larger, gooier goo-ball. The longer you hold it down,
      the deadlier.
    sprite: {fileID: 377889727691150715, guid: 98a9f682a5a2e7d4fa7e6fc7190c7fd0, type: 3}
  - ID: 0
    title: <i>Baby Spider</i>
    body: "The youngest of the spiders that you will only encounter when fighting
      the Mother, these spiders will attempt to latch on to you and weigh you down,
      slowing your flight speed drastically. Dash at a high speed to shake them off.\r"
    sprite: {fileID: -5318703033036329884, guid: 0778b2010402bc24ebd1f46986c56bcb, type: 3}
  - ID: 0
    title: <i>Young Spider</i>
    body: "The most brash, and reckless of the spiders due to their youth, these
      spiders will throw themselves at you and latch on for the ride. Dashing at
      a high speed will shake the arachnid off, additionally they are vulnerable
      while preparing to charge. \r"
    sprite: {fileID: -5318703033036329884, guid: 0778b2010402bc24ebd1f46986c56bcb, type: 3}
  - ID: 0
    title: <i>Adult Spider</i>
    body: "The adult spiders are not only much larger than the young spiders, but
      act much more tactfully. While they still will charge at you, they will only
      do so if you are at the same elevation as them. With advances in Arachnid-Engineering
      the spiders have advances not only in catching prey, but protection as well.
      They can shoot a burst fire of web-balls out of their Arachnid Anti-Aircraft
      Weapon, while also protecting all of their body, except their head, with Arachnid
      Abdomen Armor.\r"
    sprite: {fileID: 4706262600093960487, guid: eb703650a73ac934aad3602b5218c5a1, type: 3}
  - ID: 0
    title: <i>Mother of all Spiders (MOAS)</i>
    body: "The root of all spiders. The mothers have a lot of the same tactics as
      the adult spiders. Carrying more advanced Arachnid-Engineering prototypes,
      the MOAS\u2019 shoot faster web balls, and heavier, but slower Arachnid Abdomen
      Armor. The mothers will also make use of their children spitting out 5 to weigh
      you down to make it easier for the mother to catch you. \r"
    sprite: {fileID: 900397948263619752, guid: fcbbcb5122db7434db0d10a27baf39fe, type: 3}
